板，反射着精确的镜面亮点的环境光。环境元素保持比例比例关系，玻璃窗帘壁的几何图案有节奏地重复到远处。在移动自动扶梯步骤上的轻微运动模糊与使用平移技术捕获的受试者的清晰焦点形成对比。"], "两名亚洲妇女在戏剧性，尘土飞扬的沙漠景观中的照片。左边的女人有长长的黑发，穿着黄色的连衣裙和灰色外套。她的体格苗条，热情地微笑。右边的女人有肩长的奥本头发，白色连帽衫和格子裙，具有细长的身材。她摆姿势和平标志，看上去很自信。背景具有坚固的悬崖，多云的天空和分散的人，创造了冒险和友情的感觉。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 337, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 195, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "bbda5e52ad580c13ceaa53136d9c2bed9137bd2e", "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 24}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "text", "slot_index": 0, "links": [337], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [210, 310], "pos": [-368.9708251953125, -863.5701293945312], "widgets_values": ["auto", "chinese (simplified)", false, "", "", "GoogleTranslator [free]", "", "proxy_hide", "authorization_hide", [false, true], [false, true], [false, true]], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 338, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 196, "type": "DeepTranslatorTextNode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_custom_nodes_alekpet", "ver": "5fc22da44a04b8d5f75e91d0d9bb9f961e5ab721", "Node name for S&R": "DeepTranslatorTextNode"}, "order": 22}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [338, 341], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["append", "yes", "", "", "", [false, true], [false, true], [false, true], "Photograph of two Asian women in a dramatic, dusty desert landscape. The woman on the left has long black hair, wearing a yellow dress and a grey jacket. She has a slim physique and is smiling warmly. The woman on the right has shoulder-length auburn hair, a white hoodie, and a plaid skirt, with a slender build. She's posing with a peace sign, looking confident. The background features rug